to see her as a potential suspect. She is also the most spiritual and eccentric of the main characters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chaos;Head Noah:"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It is revealed that Ayase doesn't see the world the same way as other people, probably since she became a Gigalomaniac. She always sees a world with a red sky full of people with malice and negative delusions, and the reason why Ayase was able to know immediately that Takumi was a Gigalomaniac like her the first time she sees him, is most likely also because of that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4658"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私立翠明学園」二年生で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人気バンド「ファンタズム」のボーカル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"淡々とした口調で、大人っぽく見られがちだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぞの実アンニュイで無気力、感受性が高く、言動はかなり電波系。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16998","sourceWorkId":"9960","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。翠明学園の2年生で、拓巳とは違うクラス。人気バンド「ファンタズム」のボーカル「FES」として音楽活動もしている。長身で寡黙、神秘的で妖艶さをも持ち合わせる美少女だが、発言の殆どが電波で一般人には理解不能な事ばかりするためコミュニケーションが取れる人物は極めて少ない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"4834"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d744b9c34d6214e87a9345668be2935256e4d9a1b451875537af4fb0f7ae032.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3efd33bfd512aa2aa355d2795bfc3cc6b24a57fe6df00f83b62f7d916ee1d00.webp","width":113,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榊原ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s272","name":"榊原 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13166:4834:4916:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4659","characterName":"女子Ａ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"4835","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1410"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16996"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4659"},"originalCharacterName":"女子Ａ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1018"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Suimei Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takumi initially believes her to be a stalker but quickly befriends her after discovering that she's a fellow otaku."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chaos;Head Noah Spoilers:"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In Chaos;Head Noah, it is revealed that she's in fact Mia and the one that really died was Yua. Afterwards, Mia started suffering from real DID, believing that she was Yua while unconsciously blaming herself as the one that should have died instead of her twin sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4659"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私立翠明学園」三年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にでも優しく、年下にも敬語で話す少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し気の弱い面があるが、我慢強い所もあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度決めたことは、最後までやり遂げようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16996","sourceWorkId":"9960","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。翠明学園3年生。誰に対しても敬語を使う心優しい眼鏡っ娘。普段は少し気弱でも一度決めた事はとことんやり遂げようとする性格。だが豹変すると冷徹かつ威圧的な口調と化して乱暴な手段を取るようになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"4835"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26646e57b1cddbf25eafc7032d231ce6923afc55657d73d5bea4d43c6a8fa8a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/3240ec505d1ddda53eec8583c0cfc10617ad32b92cca5cc6239cff0cb1fb3c5d.webp","width":199,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たかはし智秋","creatorId":"vndb:s287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s287","name":"たかはし 智秋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13166:4835:4604:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4660","characterName":"女子Ｂ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20680","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1410"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16995"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4660"},"originalCharacterName":"女子Ｂ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"308"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"75"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Suimei Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takumi first encounters her at school but quickly excuses himself after facing her ominous glare. She is often seen standing around Shibuya holding a very long sword and eating a light blue ice pop."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4660"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私立翠明学園」の三年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールで人を寄せ付けない性格で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰彼かまわず睨みつけるため、いつも一人でいて、クラスでは浮いた存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校にもほとんど来ず、毎日のように渋谷を徘徊しているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16995","sourceWorkId":"9960","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。翠明学園3年生。好きな教科は科学で幅広い理系の知識を持っている。男勝りで強気の性格をしているのだが、実際にはその凛々しい姿からは想像出来ないほど気が弱くてヘタレであり、それを周囲に悟らせない為に強気の態度で隠しているに過ぎない。子犬が苦手。拓巳からは梢と並んで「貧乳姉妹」と称された。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20680"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/823e918eae9ce95b2117e91936fd4fa8e5d00e1e3a8a045d1b3ac578e9461cf4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83aa79ed4e2b1c7576753b935cd0d3bd301982746c30f893f43ca65da26586ec.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"生天目仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s270","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s270","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s270","name":"生天目仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13166:20680:4394:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c4661","characterName":"こずぴぃ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"4836","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1410"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16997"],"vndbCharacterId":"c4661"},"originalCharacterName":"こずぴぃ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1113"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewS